5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! Let's all be honest and find the werewolf quickly! I'll be looking for anyone acting weird!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer a methodical approach. Let's establish how we'll verify claims and look for logical inconsistencies in our arguments.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. A calm, logical analysis of behavior is the most reliable way to identify deception. Let's keep our observations objective.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is indeed the only tool we have. I will be analyzing the flow of conversation to see who is trying too hard to lead.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be observing your reactions. Deception usually leaves a trail in the way people respond to pressure. I'll judge based on those patterns.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"That sounds a bit scary, Shion! But I'm not afraid! I'll just trust my gut and the facts I find!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Gut feelings are unreliable. We should prioritize evidence and cross-reference statements to find contradictions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. If we focus on the structure of the arguments rather than emotions, we can avoid being misled by a clever actor.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Emotional appeals are often used as a smokescreen by those who lack a logical defense for their position.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Precisely. The more someone tries to sound ""helpful"" or ""excited,"" the more I'll be questioning their true motives.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hey! I'm just being me! @Shion, you're being too mean! Let's just focus on the game and have fun!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Let's not get distracted by personal dynamics. We should decide how we'll handle a Seer's claim if one emerges.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,A good point. We should evaluate the Seer's claims based on whether the results align with the behavior of the suspected players.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,We must also consider the possibility of a fake Seer. A claim must be scrutinized for consistency over several days.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll be looking for the gap between a claim and the actual outcome. Logic doesn't lie, but people do.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I've got a great plan! I'll find the bad guy and tell you all! Let's get started!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I will remain observant. I'll wait for the first night's results to start forming a hypothesis.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
