24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have a solid baseline. Let's proceed with a clear mind and a focus on the evidence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. I will be watching for any logical lapses in your reasoning.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,I'm looking forward to seeing who cracks first under the weight of their own lies.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
